   "changeReason": "Shawn 2026-10-31: swapping the battery backpack and the charger box on the OpenRB pack takes too long, so they stick on with Dual Lock (the two narrow strips in hand) and a printed back plate carries it. The plate has the V1.8 pack cover outline (|y| <= 18.6, z -44..29.5; no wings, Shawn: \"为什么要两个翅膀 好丑哦\"), is 3 mm thick (the same four M2 x 6 go through with 3 mm of thread in the posts; their heads stand outside the Dual Lock area), has no lip, and a top notch (|y| <= 13.5, z 27 up) for the charger box's old front lip. Both backpacks print unchanged and sit about 8.7 mm further back (3 mm plate plus the Dual Lock). Fit at rest: no overlap; nearest parts the shells 1.4 / 1.9 mm.",
